  "pirate_piastrs": "Piastres",
  "pirate_piastrs_desc": "We have great news! For every hour played, you get Piastres!",
  "pirate_sea_battle": "SEA BATTLE",
  "pirate_sea_battle_desc": "We present to your attention a new mode on Grand Arena - “Sea Battle”! You will become an artilleryman and take part in an exciting battle between two ships - “Black Pearl” and “Interceptor”!",
  "pirate_quest_line": "Quest line",
  "pirate_quest_line_desc": "A ship has docked at our wonderful Arzamas train station! Meet the ship's captain and go on an exciting journey for which you will receive a generous reward!",
  "pirate_mark_on_map": "Mark on map",
  "pirate_about_event": "Event info",
  "pirate_about_event_desc": "When you enter the interface, you'll find the Treasure Map, showing buried treasures. Dig them up to get fantastic rewards!",
  "pirate_how_to_get_prize": "HOW TO GET REWARDS",
  "pirate_how_to_get_prize_desc": "Receive gifts for unearthed treasures. Each treasure is divided into 3 stages. By clicking on the “Dig” button the excavation process begins: you receive a prize, shovels are written off and one of the stages of the treasure is activated. As soon as the treasure has three active stages, it is considered dug up, and you automatically move on to the next treasure.",
  "pirate_tasks": "TASKS",
  "pirate_tasks_desc": "To get Piasters and Shovels, you need to open the page with Tasks related to the game mechanics. Upon completion of these tasks, you will receive a reward in the form of shovels needed for the Treasure Map, as well as Piastres and cosmetic items.",
  "pirate_additional": "Details",
  "pirate_additional_desc": "The Treasure Map and the Tasks can be upgraded to the second level after the full completion to receive more valuable prizes.\nThe mini-game “Sea Battle” in the Grand Arena has been restarted.\nFor each hour played, you get Piastres!\nThe quest line “Pirate Treasures” has been restarted.\nThe most active players of the event will get into the leaderboards.",
