  "drag_race_dialog_welcome": "Welcome\nTO THE GRAND MOBILE RACING EVENT",
  "drag_race_dialog_desc": "Feel like a real racer, upgrade your car, and take part in daily Drag Racing competitions!",
  "drag_race_season_pass_desc": "Complete story races and get rewards",
  "drag_race_season_pass_rating_desc": "Win races in rating races and get badges",
  "drag_race_education_desc": "If you don't have enough currency to buy parts and upgrade your car, you can replay story races.\nIn the event's Season Pass, you can earn various parts as well as valuable character customization items.\nThe most active players receive leaderboard rewards in ranked races.\nBy fully completing the story, you will earn the Boss’s car, which you can upgrade to perform better in ranked races.\nEach day a new season of the Drome League begins: 30% of the top players are promoted to a higher league, 20% of the lowest-ranked players are demoted, and the rest stay in their current league. Promotions depend on the number of victories.",
  "drag_race_education_0": "Welcome to the Drag Racing event! You’ll go through a big storyline, tune your car, and compete for awesome prizes in ranked races! But first, you need to choose your first car. You can pick from three different cars based on your preference. Later, other cars can be unlocked using special cards.",
  "drag_race_education_1": "The garage displays all of your cars. By pressing the “Tune” button, you can upgrade certain car parts, affecting your speed and performance in future races. In the “Upgrade” tab, you can level up your car, which also increases its speed. To get car cards and part upgrades, we recommend checking out the shop.",
  "drag_race_education_2": "There are 30 story races in total, where you'll face off against a boss. To successfully complete the storyline, don't forget to tune your car with special parts and upgrades. With each upgrade level, your car becomes faster. Additionally, cars have star levels, and reaching each new star level makes the car even faster.",
  "drag_race_education_3": "After completing the storyline, we invite you to participate in ranked races. Ranked races are divided into two types: the global leaderboard and the Drome Championship. In the global leaderboard, your rating is compared to all players — the higher your rating, the higher your position on the leaderboard. At the end of the event, you’ll receive awesome rewards based on your leaderboard ranking.",
