  "expeditionAboutDesc": "When you enter the event, you're greeted by the Expedition Map, which you’ll need to explore!",
  "expeditionAboutHowToTitle": "HOW TO GET REWARDS",
  "expeditionAboutHowToDesc": "To get rewards, you need to complete route points and unlock locations. To do that, you'll need energy and keys!",
  "expeditionAboutTasksTitle": "Task Stand",
  "expeditionAboutTasksDesc": "To get energy, go to the Task Stand and complete a series of tasks. Completing them gives you energy to progress through the map, and gold coins you can spend in our shop!",
