  "expeditionAboutAdditionalDescP0": "After completing all tasks, you can upgrade the Task Stand to level 2 to receive better rewards.",
  "expeditionAboutAdditionalDescP1": "Every 10 minutes, energy appears across the map. You can collect it, but the amount is limited.",
  "expeditionAboutAdditionalDescP2": "Every 20 minutes, a large Airdrop will appear on the map. Up to 4 players can open it and find gold coins, energy, and a key inside. The amount is limited.",
  "expeditionAboutAdditionalDescP3": "During the event, the 'Energy Piggy Bank' promo is active. By earning energy in various ways, you’ll duplicate and store it in the piggy bank. Once you've saved at least half of the maximum, you can break it and claim your energy. You can break the piggy bank only once during the entire event. Energy earned from completing tasks beyond the 500-unit limit will be lost and won’t be added to the piggy bank.",
  "expeditionAboutAdditionalDescP4": "During the event, the 'Energy Challenge' tournament will appear! Earn energy to climb the leaderboard. The more energy you collect, the higher your position and the better your prize! The tournament lasts 48 hours from its start.",
  "expeditionAboutAdditionalDescP5": "For a better start, you can get login rewards during the first 7 days of the event!",
  "expeditionAboutAdditionalDescP6": "Keys are earned by progressing through the map, finding airdrops, and participating in various promotions.",
