  "chaosMentorName": "Doctor Chaos",
  "chaosStep0Part0Title": "Welcome to my tournament, contestant.",
  "chaosStep0Part0Text": "Today you will receive your first cars, complete\nstarter tasks, figure out the garage, and enter\nthe arena to prove that you deserve to stay in the game.",
  "chaosStep0Part1Text": "Don't try to understand all the chaos at once. Go step by step: the story\nwill show you the rules, the garage will strengthen your car, and PVP will quickly\nexplain who is the hunter here and who is just a target.",
  "chaosStep0Part2Text": "In the open world, there are zones where other contestants either simply\ntest each other or pursue their own goals. To reach them, summon your car at any parking lot and\nhead to any zone — but only alone, without passengers.",
  "chaosStep0Part3Title": "City",
  "chaosStep0Part3Text": "This is your control center in my tournament.\nFrom here, you can access the story, PVP, tasks,\ngarage, rewards, and other event sections.",
  "chaosStep0Part4Text": "Keep track of your progress, resources, and active\ngoals. The more often you return here, the\nless likely you are to miss an important reward\nor the next step.",
  "chaosStep1Part0Title": "Storyline",
  "chaosStep1Part0Text": "This is where your journey through the city begins — a city where the rules\nare written by those who survived. Complete missions, defeat\nbosses, and unlock new stages of the tournament.",
  "chaosStep1Part1Text": "The story will teach you the basics of the event: combat, upgrades,\ntravel, and key mechanics. Don't skip it\nif you want to understand how to escape the chaos as a winner.",
  "chaosStep1Part2Title": "First Mission",
  "chaosStep1Part2Text": "Start your first mission by spending\nfuel. Once you complete it,\nyou will receive the reward automatically.",
  "chaosStep1Part3UpgradeButton": "Upgrade",
  "chaosStep1Part3Title": "Stats",
  "chaosStep1Part3Text": "Each vehicle has its own stats.\nWhen selecting a vehicle, you will always\nsee them. If you have enough resources, you can\nupgrade the selected vehicle — to do this,\npress the “Upgrade” button.",
  "chaosStep1Part4HealthLabel": "Vehicle health",
  "chaosStep1Part4Title": "Vehicle Health",
  "chaosStep1Part4Text": "In the storyline, each vehicle\nhas its own health — it is carried over\nfrom previous missions and gradually\nrecovers on its own. But you can always\nrestore it for GC or\nwith an event Repair Kit, which you will\nreceive as you progress through the event.",
  "chaosStep1Part5Title": "Boosters",
  "chaosStep1Part5Text": "Each vehicle has its own stats.\nWhen selecting a vehicle, you will always\nsee them. If you have enough resources, you can\nupgrade the selected vehicle — to do this,\npress the “Upgrade” button.",
  "chaosStep2Part0Text": "In this section, you go up against other players.\nChoose a mode, start matchmaking, and prove\nthat your car was made for more than just looks.",
  "chaosStep2Part1Text": "PVP victories bring progress and a place in the ranking. Here,\nit's not only the strength of your car that matters, but also how you use\nspeed, armor, and collisions.",
  "chaosStep3Part0Title": "Tasks",
  "chaosStep3Part0Text": "This section contains goals that will help you\nprogress through the event faster.\nComplete daily tasks in the open world to\nreceive resources, REP, and additional rewards.",
  "chaosStep3Part1Text": "Tasks will tell you what to do next\nif you don't know where to go. Just choose\na goal — and the city itself will find a way to test you.",
  "chaosStep4Part0Title": "Travel",
  "chaosStep4Part0Text": "This section helps you quickly reach the right\npoint in the event. Use travel to\navoid wasting time on long routes and move faster\nto missions, battles, and activities.",
  "chaosStep5Part0Title": "Garage",
  "chaosStep5Part0Text": "Your event cars are stored in the garage. Here you\nchoose a vehicle, view its stats,\nupgrade it, and prepare it for story missions and PVP.",
  "chaosStep5Part1Text": "Each car differs in speed, armor,\nhealth, damage, and collision power.\nChoose a car that fits your style: crush, overtake,\nor outlast those who are too confident.",
  "chaosStep6Part0Title": "Storage",
  "chaosStep6Part0Text": "The storage contains resources, components, and items\nthat you received during the event. Check it\nhere to see what has already been collected and what can\nbe used for progress.",
  "chaosStep6Part1Text": "If something dropped, it won't get lost.\nI love chaos, but even chaos needs\norder in the inventory.",
  "chaosStep7Part0Title": "Rating",
  "chaosStep7Part0Text": "Here you can see your place among the other\ncontestants of the tournament. The more REP\nand PVP victories you have, the higher you climb.",
  "chaosStep7Part1Title": "Rating",
  "chaosStep7Part1Text": "The rating shows who is truly dangerous,\nand who just revs their engine loudly.\nWant to be noticed? Climb higher.",
  "chaosStep8Part0Text": "The Season Pass shows your overall\nevent progress. Earn event\nexperience, unlock levels, and claim\nrewards for your activity.",
  "chaosStep8Part1Text": "Come back here after missions, PVP\n\nand tasks. Maybe you've already earned\na prize — you just haven't claimed it yet.",
  "chaosStep9Part0Title": "Shop",
  "chaosStep9Part0Text": "This section contains additional rewards\nand special event offers. Here\nyou can find resources, items, and other\nuseful prizes for participating in the tournament.",
  "chaosStep9Part1Text": "Check this section after important stages of the event.\nSometimes the most interesting opportunities\nappear right after you survive\nanother explosion.",
  "chaosStep9Part2Text": "Here you can also enhance boosters that help\nin battles and event progression. Upgraded boosters provide\nmore benefits and let you feel more confident\nin missions.",
  "chaosStep9Part3Text": "Choose enhancements that match your playstyle. Want to crush harder\n— upgrade attack; want to live longer — take care of defense.\nBut remember: enhancements do not work in PvP — this ensures\na fair fight.",
  "chaosStep10Part0Title": "Settings",
  "chaosStep10Part0Text": "In settings, you can adjust event parameters\nto your preference. Here you can configure elements that\nhelp you play more comfortably and better\ncontrol what is happening.",
  "chaosFuelConfirmText": "Are you sure you want to\nadd {fuelValue} liters of fuel?",
  "chaosPvpCancelText": "Are you sure you want to cancel\nplayer search?",
  "chaosPvpCancelButton": "Yes, cancel search",
  "srv2title": "ЛЕТНИЙ РАЗГОН",
  "chaosFuelConfirmButton": "Refill for",

