  "schTutorialPickTeamPrompt": "Choose a team",
  "schTutorialBankBreak": "Break",
  "schTutorialT0S0": "Hey there, student! Welcome to the <g>School Battle!</g>\nI'm the Principal around here, and I'll warn you right away — no free rides.\nYour most important document for the next month is this <g>School Diary</g>!",
  "schTutorialT0S1": "On the left is your cheat-sheet menu. <g>Remember:</g>\n\n- In <g>Quests</g>, you get extra assignments\nto earn bells;\n\n- In <g>Duels</g>, you find out who's the boss during recess,\nand you can earn awesome rewards there;\n\n- In the <g>Leaderboard</g>, you can compete\nagainst other players for awesome prizes;\n\n- And in the <g>Store</g> and <g>Season Pass</g>, you can grab\nthe juiciest loot!",
  "schTutorialT0S2": "Time to decide who you really are! Choose your side: hit the books\nwith the <g>Nerd Kit</g> or stir up trouble with the <g>Bully Kit</g>.\nThe kits are limited — the timer is already ticking!",
  "schTutorialT0S4": "Keep an eye on your bonuses on the right.\nComplete <g>Pass</g> levels to\nunlock exclusive rides,\nand don't forget to break open your <g>Piggy Bank</g>\nfor staying active every day!",
  "schTutorialT0S5": "Got it all? Then get to class, and don't be late!\nShow everyone who's the top student around here!",
  "schTutorialT1S0": "Here's your ultimate school report card — your <g>Season Pass</g>!\nYou can tell right away who's a big deal at school\nand who's just wasting time in the back row.",
  "schTutorialT1S1": "This is your <g>Current Level and XP</g>. Study hard — complete\nquests and play to fill up the XP bar. Every time\nyou fill it, your privileges go up a level!",
  "schTutorialT1S2": "Don't like buying a pig in a poke? Click any reward\nfrom the list below, and you'll be able to take\na closer look before deciding whether to skip it or claim it.",
  "schTutorialT1S3": "At the bottom is the <g>Reward Track</g>. The free row\nunlocks for everyone as their level increases.\nLevel up — then claim the reward you've earned!",
  "schTutorialT1S4": "And if you want twice as much loot and a chance to cruise around\nin an exclusive <g>Mercedes-Benz</g>, activate the <g>Premium Pass!</g>\nThere's even a great discount on it right now.",
  "schTutorialT1S5": "Stop daydreaming! Level up\nyour Pass and claim your first rewards!",
  "schTutorialT2S0": "Welcome to the showdown behind the school garage! The\n<g>Duels</g> screen is where the eternal rivalry between the <g>Nerds</g> and <g>Bullies</g> plays out.\nThis is where we decide which faction rules the whole school!",
  "schTutorialT2S1PlayerTeamBlue": "blue is your team, red is your opponent",
  "schTutorialT2S1PlayerTeamRed": "red is your team, blue is your opponent",
  "schTutorialT2S1": "Keep an eye on the bar: {playerTeamText}.\nPoints are earned through the actions of every faction member.\nTap <g>Battle Info</g> to learn the rules\nand participation requirements for Duels!",
  "schTutorialT2S2": "Your <g>Influence Points</g> are displayed in the top-right corner.\nThat's your personal contribution to the team. Don't slack off in class and\nkeep playing to carry your team all the way to the top!",
  "schTutorialT2S3": "And here's the main motivation!\nWin the battle, and when the timer runs out you'll score\na huge prize: <g>Bells</g> and <g>Grand Coins</g>! The winner\ntakes it all! Remember, your reward depends on how much\nyou contributed to your team's victory.",
  "schTutorialT2S4": "So don't let your faction down!\nEarn Influence Points and lead your team to victory!",
  "schTutorialT3S0": "Welcome to the school's <g>Hall of Fame</g>! Here you can instantly see\nwho's top of the class in points and who's lagging\nbehind with the slackers. Time to show everyone who's number one!",
  "schTutorialT3S1": "Switch between the tabs! In <g>Team</g>, you compete against\nother members of your faction,\nwhile in <g>Global</g>, you fight for first place among absolutely all\nplayers on the server!",
  "schTutorialT3S2": "The top three get the coolest rewards and all the glory! Your current\nposition is always highlighted in green. Complete activities\nand earn bells to climb higher and higher!",
  "schTutorialT3S3": "Hard work at school deserves serious rewards!\nOn the right, you can see the available prizes\nfor high-ranking positions. Tap <g>All Rewards</g> to\ncheck out the entire leaderboard prize pool!",
  "schTutorialT3S4": "Keep an eye on the timer below! The leaderboard regularly\nlocks in the results. Don't get too comfortable, or\nyour rivals will knock you off the podium in no time!",
  "schTutorialT3S5": "Got it? Then get out there, earn points\nand fight your way to the top!",
  "schTutorialT4S0": "All right, open your diaries and write down your homework!\nThe <g>Quests</g> section is your main job every day.\nNo homework — no rewards!",
  "schTutorialT4S1": "● In <g>Goals</g>, you complete your main school assignments to\nearn extra bells and make progress in Duels;\n● In the <g>Season Pass</g> tab, you'll find special quests that grant pure\nXP for leveling up your Pass!",
  "schTutorialT4S2": "Each card shows a specific requirement.\nKeep an eye on the green progress bar: it shows\nexactly how much you have left — for example, 3 actions out of 5!",
  "schTutorialT4S3": "Completing quests earns you bells, Influence Points for\nDuels, and XP. Once the bar is completely filled — tap\nthe big yellow <g>Collect</g> button and claim your hard-earned\nbonuses!",
  "schTutorialT4S4": "Don't fall behind on your schoolwork! Complete quests every day,\nand you'll reach the top of the school in no time.\nNow get to work!",
  "schTutorialT6S0": "Here to spend your pocket money? Perfect!\nWelcome to our <g>School Store</g>!\nEverything you've honestly earned from lessons and quests\ncan be traded here for exclusive gear!",
  "schTutorialT6S1": "<g>Showcase</g> — ready-to-buy items with fixed prices;\n<g>Cases</g> — for those who want to test their luck and hit the jackpot;\n<g>Boosters</g> — power-ups for those who don't like waiting around!",
  "schTutorialT6S2": "The <g>Showcase</g> is simple and straightforward: choose a skin\nor accessory you like, check the price in <g>school bells</g> in the corner\nof the card, and send it straight to your wardrobe!",
  "schTutorialT6S3": "Try it on, buy it, and upgrade your style!\nBut remember: the best outfit is the one\nyou earned through your victories!",
  "schTutorialT7S0": "Like testing your luck during recess?\nThe <g>“Cases”</g> tab is your personal lottery!\nThe rarest and most valuable event loot is hidden here.",
  "schTutorialT7S1": "Let's start with the freebies! The first case can be opened <g>for bells</g> once\nevery few hours.\nLog in, wait for the timer to run out — then claim your\nguaranteed reward!",
  "schTutorialT7S2": "Want more, faster? Open paid cases for <g>Grand Coins</g>.\nThe better the case, the higher your chance of getting an exclusive\nvehicle or skin!",
  "schTutorialT7S3": "So, is luck on your side?\nTest your fortune and claim some top-tier loot!",
  "schTutorialT8S0": "Need some legal “cheat codes” for a quick win?\nThe <g>Boosters</g> section is your personal performance boost! Here you'll find\nspecial upgrades that give you an edge over\nyour rivals.",
  "schTutorialT8S1": "Stock up on everything you need — \nand get out there to show everyone on the streets\nwho graduated at the top of the class!",
  "schTutorialT9S0": "Thought I didn't know about your stash in the school locker?\nThe Piggy Bank is your personal savings fund. Bonus\nbells pile up here while you take part in the event!",
  "schTutorialT9S1": "It's simple: for every bell you earn in the game,\nthe same number of bonus bells automatically goes straight\ninto this locker. You just keep playing, and your stash grows on its own!",
  "schTutorialT9S2": "You can collect your savings at any time! Grab a baseball\nbat, tap <g>Break</g> and pay with Grand Coins\n— and your entire locked-away treasure will instantly be transferred to your\nmain balance!",
  "schTutorialT9S3": "Save up as much as you can, break it open at the right moment,\nand buy out the whole store!",

